      {
        "text": "types of regions (text, titles, tables, graphics, etc.) within a document. Over the past few years, DLA",
        "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
        "font_size": 9.962599754333496,
        "font_flags": 4,
        "color": 0,
        "bbox": [
