          544.3101806640625,
          504.0033264160156,
          554.2727661132812
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "when faced with diverse document formats, existing layout analysis algorithms (Huang et al., 2022;",
        "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
        "font_size": 9.962599754333496,
        "font_flags": 4,
        "color": 0,
        "bbox": [
          107.99993896484375,
          555.2691650390625,
          504.0031433105469,
          565.2317504882812
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Li et al., 2022) still struggle with speed and accuracy.",
        "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
        "font_size": 9.962599754333496,
        "font_flags": 4,
        "color": 0,
        "bbox": [
